msgstr "远程文件编辑器"

msgid "The file is copied, edited, then sent back to the server."
msgstr "文件被复制、编辑，然后发送回服务器。"

msgid "Program opened on double-click. Empty, Windows decides."
msgstr "双击时打开的程序。留空则由 Windows 决定。"

msgid "No editor chosen"
msgstr "未选择编辑器"

msgid "Browse..."
msgstr "浏览…"

